<title>USA: Florida to sell $10.23 million bond issue Tuesday.</title>
<headline>Florida to sell $10.23 million bond issue Tuesday.</headline>
<dateline>TALLAHASSEE, Fla 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Florida will sell $10.23 million of regents bonds by competitive bid on Tuesday at 11 a.m. EST, the state Division of Bond Finance said Monday.</p>
<p>The issue is Board of Regents, University of South Florida Housing Facility Revenue Bonds, Series 1996A.</p>
<p>--Jane Sutton, 305-374-5013</p>
